2026-09-11T02:04:26Z == disabling Cross Site Scripting (DOM Based), plugin 40026 ==
2026-09-11T02:04:26Z measured: this rule (which drives a headless browser via Crawljax/HtmlUnit, same as the AJAX spider) OOM-killed the ZAP container 4/4 times at ~34% active-scan progress, at container memory ceilings from 4g to 8g and JVM heaps from 2048m to 3072m - see bench/results/b7-dast-juiceshop/README.md. Disabling it is a real, disclosed scope reduction, not a silent one: DAST-INJ-XSS_REFLECTED_* is scored against scoursh's own reflected-XSS checks, never against a DOM-XSS rule neither tool actually ran to completion here.
